nt of\n$$\n\\displaystyle \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3 & z \\\\ z & -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\nis $-48$, find all the possible values of $z.$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "Let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3 & z \\\\ z & -1 & 1\\end{vmatrix} & =2\\begin{vmatrix}3 & z \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{vmatrix}-1\\begin{vmatrix}2 & z \\\\ z & 1\\end{vmatrix}+5\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ z & -1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =2(3+z)-(2-{z}^{2})+5(-2-3z) \\\\  & =6+2z-2+{z}^{2}-10-15z \\\\  & ={z}^{2}-13z-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $-48,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}-13z-6 & =-48 \\\\ {z}^{2}-13z+42 & =0 \\\\ z & =\\frac{-(-13)\\pm \\sqrt{{13}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 42}}{2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{13\\pm \\sqrt{1}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{13\\pm 1}{2} \\\\  & =6,7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $z=6$ and $z=7.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265937 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cbb6fbea-1024-5d3a-b73a-2652854807d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439539} {:answer/id #uuid "bd68a459-7909-5063-ad2f-80212bf601c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439540}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186439540} :answer-field/id #uuid "875c3194-24a6-51ec-b673-71d77e13cf9f" :answer-field/key "$x=-8$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440127} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "db104ef8-98d3-5cd8-a99b-bdad6e429a02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439541} {:answer/id #uuid "1926db50-38a9-55a3-a39f-74a8cd416c7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439542}] :answer-